le in their early 20s with a 4 year degree, but their corner of the labor market is finally improving.\n\nOver the past 11 months their unemployment rate averaged 6.58%, down from 6.76% a year earlier https://t.co/rTkd9BMRGd", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120212883997123061"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:44:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120210895972499874"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8e064TXq62", "end": 218, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120210895972499874/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120210890897408000", "start": 195, "url": "https://t.co/8e064TXq62"}]}, "id": "2120210895972499874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2108, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Private sector employment growth measured by ADP slowed from mid-September to late October, but remains stronger than it was over the summer... consistent with further unemployment rate declines https://t.co/8e064TXq62", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120210895972499874"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:00:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120199867914199097"], "id": "2120199867914199097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 90, "impression_count": 112878, "like_count": 920, "quote_count": 18, "reply_count": 143, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "Would it be fair to characterize the state of enterprise AI adoption as: \n\n\"We don't really know if we're getting any return from all this spending, but our employees would lose their shit if we took the tools away?\"", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120199867914199097"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:56:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120198873360585059"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 84, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2120197613307711913", "start": 61,